// rest at the end of the `blockencodings_tests` suite. Build it with
// `make -C src test/test_dash` and run
// `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=blockencodings_tests/<name>` with
// `--log_level=nothing --report_level=no`. The output should match the
// section. Run each program on its own, since their helper definitions
// overlap.
